  "type": "order.created",
  "occurred_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:44Z",
  "payload": { "order_id": "ord_4471" }
}}}

<h2 id="replay">Replay a dead-lettered event</h2>
<p><code>POST /v3/events/{id}/replay</code> — re-runs an event that exhausted its retries from where it was dead-lettered. See the <code>Handling errors &amp; retries</code> guide for when to use this versus reprocessing an entire time range.</p>

