    "short_description": "Create, list, and manage pipelines via the v3 REST API.",
    "body": "<h1>Pipelines endpoint {{ds:component/chip|label=v3|variant=primary}}</h1>
<p>Create and manage <a href={{cms:item/5ac66235-69dc-4092-b430-9d68837e0c76}}>pipelines</a> programmatically. Base URL: <code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>.</p>

{{ds:component/alert|variant=success|title=New in v3|body_html=<p>v3 introduces batch operations, improved filtering on list endpoints, and enhanced error messages. See the changelog or review the migration guide for details.</p>}}

<h2 id=create>Create a pipeline</h2>
<p><code>POST /v3/pipelines</code></p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>Human-readable pipeline name, unique per workspace.</td></tr><tr><td><code>source_connector_id</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>ID of the connector events are read from.</td></tr><tr><td><code>destination_connector_id</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>ID of the connector events are written to.</td></tr><tr><td><code>transforms</code></td><td>array</td><td>No</td><td>Ordered list of transform step definitions. Omit for a pass-through copy.</td></tr><tr><td><code>schedule</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Cron expression. Omit for event-triggered (streaming) pipelines.</td></tr><tr><td><code>tags</code></td><td>object</td><td>No</td><td>Optional metadata tags for organization and filtering (new in v3).</td></tr>}}

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=create-pipeline.sh|language=bash|code=curl -X POST https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3/pipelines \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $GODZILLA_API_KEY" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '&#123;\n    "name": "ingest-orders",\n    "source_connector_id": "conn_pg_orders",\n    "destination_connector_id": "conn_snowflake_dw",\n    "tags": &#123;\n      "team": "analytics",\n      "environment": "production"\n    &#125;\n  &#125;'}}

<h2 id=list>List pipelines</h2>
<p><code>GET /v3/pipelines</code> — cursor-paginated, see <code>Rate limits & errors</code> for the pagination envelope.</p>

<p>v3 adds support for filtering by name, state, and tags. Use query parameters to refine results:</p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter by pipeline name (partial match).</td></tr><tr><td><code>state</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter by state: draft, active, or paused.</td></tr><tr><td><code>tags</code></td><td>object</td><td>No</td><td>Filter by tag key-value pairs (new in v3).</td></tr>}}

<h2 id=states>Pipeline states</h2>
<p>Returned pipelines include a <code>state</code> field of <code>draft</code>, <code>active</code>, or <code>paused</code> — see <a href={{cms:item/5ac66235-69dc-4092-b430-9d68837e0c76}}>Pipelines</a> for what each means.</p>

{{ds:component/alert|variant=danger|title=Deleting a pipeline|body_html=<p>Deleting a pipeline does not delete its source or destination connectors, and does not delete events already written to the destination. In-flight runs are allowed to finish before deletion completes.</p>}}

{{ds:component/docs-toc|items_html=<li><a href=#create>Create a pipeline</a></li><li><a href=#list>List pipelines</a></li><li><a href=#states>Pipeline states</a></li>}}",
